    # Operator-tunable knobs go on an inner ``class Settings(AppSettings)``
    # after importing AppSettings from druks.apps —
    # the platform picks up an inner class named ``Settings`` and turns its fields
    # (default + type + constraints + title/description) into overridable settings.
